&lt;p&gt;This Backend Engineer role is within the Asset Group, which is crucial for maintaining the company&#39;s competitive advantage by managing over 1,200 data integrations. The team is focused on developing and maintaining highly scalable infrastructure that ensures seamless data normalization and processing. The individual will adopt an end-to-end responsibility mindset to build robust, high-performance systems that drive technical success and contribute directly to customer-driven product wins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full feature development lifecycle, from initial definition through production deployment and customer usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, develop, and deploy scalable solutions rapidly to address complex technical challenges and secure key deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust, high-performance systems for managing high volumes of data in a large-scale production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical subject matter expert, providing innovative solutions to unique problems using advanced technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of professional experience as a Backend Engineer with demonstrated&amp;nbsp; infrastructure knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in coding, including participating in some formal design and code review processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with at least one communication protocol: REST, SOAP, GraphQL, LDAP, or SNMP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with at least one database technology: SQL or MongoDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional coding experience using Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Linux operating system environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with multi-process architectures, including relevant operating system system calls (e.g., Fork, exec).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical expertise with containerization (Docker), NoSQL databases (MongoDB), and cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to strategic architectural decisions and elevating the technical skill set of the engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in the cybersecurity industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
