&lt;li&gt;Prior experience researching OT (Industrial) or IoT protocols and device architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating AI/LLM tools (e.g., Gemini, GPT) to automate data processing or research tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing full-cycle research projects from initial hypothesis to final technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Vulnerability frameworks and industry standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical autonomy with the ability to build internal research tools from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
