&lt;p&gt;As a Security Researcher for the Axonius Exposures team, you will drive product innovation by performing deep-dive research into vulnerability detection, remediation, and prioritization. You will translate complex research into actionable features that help customers mitigate critical security gaps. This role bridges the gap between technical research and product impact, leveraging AI and asset intelligence to build a market-leading exposure management engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vulnerability &amp;amp; Threat Research:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct technical analysis of emerging CVEs, misconfigurations, and attack vectors across Cloud, On-prem, and IoT/OT environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remediation Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and prototype effective mitigation strategies, including configuration changes and compensating controls beyond standard patching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Prioritization:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop scoring models using Python and SQL that integrate asset criticality with exploitability data to guide customer security workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize LLMs and AI tools to automate the parsing of security advisories and scale the mapping of vulnerabilities to organizational assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 3 years of hands-on experience in security research, vulnerability analysis, or penetration testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional experience writing Python scripts for data automation and performing complex data queries using SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep technical understanding of CVSS, EPSS, MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK frameworks, and common exploitation techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Specialized knowledge in network protocols and device communication patterns (identifying device types/vulnerabilities via traffic).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of leading independent research projects from problem definition to proof-of-concept (POV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
