&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in building and maintaining &lt;strong&gt;ARR and Sales Pipeline models&lt;/strong&gt; for business forecasting and predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; for data extraction and manipulation, and expert-level proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Excel&lt;/strong&gt; for complex modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to &lt;strong&gt;design, develop, and maintain BI dashboards and reports&lt;/strong&gt; using tools such as Tableau or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; or lead analyst role supporting GTM leadership decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience working with core GTM platforms (CRM, MAP, financial systems) to ensure data structure and governance for analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific experience analyzing and reporting on &lt;strong&gt;Customer Success metrics&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., gross retention, net retention, and churn drivers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying bottlenecks and proposing data-backed operational improvements within the &lt;strong&gt;lead-to-cash process&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with market segmentation efficiency analysis and optimal sales staffing models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in financial modeling used to assess the Return on Investment (ROI) of marketing campaigns and GTM investments.&lt;/li&gt;
