&lt;p&gt;You will serve as the technical lead for the sales team, focusing on solving complex security challenges for prospective customers through the Axonius platform. The mission of this role is to drive successful product evaluations and provide expert technical guidance to secure new business within the regional market. You will bridge the gap between technical functionality and strategic business value to ensure high customer satisfaction and deal closure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
